  "description": "Shared data types of the Sweep orchestration controller: a parameter study as data for any solver family - the parameters, the variant table and exactly one family block (a CalculiX template or deck set, an OpenFOAM case) - the immutable plan with its chunk schedule, the cursor state carried across chunks, the chunk schedule a run goes by (its own job variable), and the manifest of everything harvested so far, each row the sweep's verdict plus the node's own result. The sweep state and its result index publish a document vocabulary (sweep.state@2, sweep.schedule@1) for non-.NET initiators.",
